<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Vendre sans agence — guide de particulier à particulier</title>
<link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" sizes="any">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon.svg">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#1E6B52">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Serif:wght@500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<!-- Librairie pour l'export PDF -->
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2pdf.js/0.10.1/html2pdf.bundle.min.js" defer></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#EEEDE7; --card:#FBFAF6; --ink:#1B1D1E; --ink-soft:#5A5D5E;
    --line:#D9D6CC; --line-soft:#E7E4DB;
    --pine:#1E6B52; --pine-soft:#E3EDE7; --pine-ink:#123f30;
    --ochre:#A96612; --ochre-soft:#F3E8D3; --ochre-ink:#754409;
    --brick:#9E3826; --brick-soft:#F1DED8;
    --r:11px;
    --sans:"IBM Plex Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --serif:"IBM Plex Serif",Georgia,serif;
    --mono:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);
    font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .wrap{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px 72px}
  a{color:var(--pine-ink);text-underline-offset:3px}
  h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;margin:0}

  header.top{padding:26px 0 14px}
  .kicker{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--pine-ink);margin:0 0 8px}
  header.top h1{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  header.top p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:56ch}
  .save{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:14px}
  .save .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--pine)}

  /* Stepper as folder tabs */
  nav.steps{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;background:var(--paper);
    padding:10px 0;margin:6px 0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex;gap:7px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none}
  nav.steps::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .tab{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);border-radius:9px;
    padding:8px 12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);white-space:nowrap;
    transition:border-color .15s,color .15s}
  .tab:hover{border-color:#c3bfb2}
  .tab .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:500;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:5px;
    display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--line-soft);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px}
  .tab[aria-current="true"]{border-color:var(--pine);color:var(--pine-ink);background:var(--pine-soft)}
  .tab[aria-current="true"] .num{background:var(--pine);color:#fff}
  .tab.done .num{background:var(--pine);color:#fff}
  .tab.done .num::after{content:"✓"}
  .tab.done .num span{display:none}

  .panel{display:none;animation:fade .25s ease}
  .panel.active{display:block}
  @keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.panel{animation:none}}

  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 6px}
  .panel > h2{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .lead{color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0 0 22px;max-width:60ch}

  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);
    padding:20px;margin:0 0 16px}
  .card h3{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
  .grid2{display:grid;gap:16px}
  @media(min-width:680px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}

  label.f{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 5px;color:var(--ink)}
  .hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:3px 0 0}
  input[type=text],input[type=number],select,textarea{width:100%;font:inherit;font-size:15px;
    padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
  input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus{outline:2px solid var(--pine);outline-offset:1px;border-color:var(--pine)}
  textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:92px}
  .field{margin:0 0 14px}
  .field:last-child{margin-bottom:0}

  .check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;cursor:pointer;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .check:first-of-type{border-top:0}
  .check input{margin-top:3px;width:17px;height:17px;accent-color:var(--pine);flex:0 0 auto}
  .check span{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5}
  .check small{display:block;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:13px}

  .pill{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px;
    letter-spacing:.03em;vertical-align:middle}
  .pill.req{background:var(--ochre-soft);color:var(--ochre-ink)}
  .pill.ok{background:var(--pine-soft);color:var(--pine-ink)}

  .note{border-left:3px solid var(--pine);background:var(--pine-soft);color:var(--pine-ink);
    padding:12px 14px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 0}
  .note.warn{border-color:var(--ochre);background:var(--ochre-soft);color:var(--ochre-ink)}
  .note.alert{border-color:var(--brick);background:var(--brick-soft);color:#7a2c1e}
  .note strong{font-weight:600}

  .links a{display:block;padding:9px 0;font-size:14.5px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .links a:first-child{border-top:0}

  .annonce{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;white-space:pre-wrap;
    background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;color:var(--ink);
    max-height:none}
  .btn{font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;border-radius:8px;
    padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid var(--pine);background:var(--pine);color:#fff}
  .btn:hover{background:var(--pine-ink)}
  .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--pine-ink)}
  .btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--pine-soft)}
  .btn.mini{padding:7px 12px;font-size:13px}
  .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center}

  .metric{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:11px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .metric:first-child{border-top:0}
  .metric .lab{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .metric .val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:18px;font-weight:500}
  .delta.pos{color:var(--pine-ink)} .delta.neg{color:var(--brick)}

  .results{margin-top:8px}
  .res-item{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;
    cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;margin-top:8px}
  .res-item:hover{border-color:var(--pine)}

  .navflow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:26px}

  footer{margin-top:40px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  footer .tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:0 0 16px}
  footer p{margin:6px 0}
  .sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)}

  /* ===== BANDEAU DE PROGRESSION ===== */
  .progress-bar-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem 0;
      padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--r);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }

  .progress-step {
      flex: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.2rem;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: default;
      position: relative;
  }

  .progress-step:not(:last-child)::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      right: -8%;
      width: 16%;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--line);
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }

  .progress-step.active:not(:last-child)::after,
  .progress-step.completed:not(:last-child)::after {
      background: var(--pine);
  }

  .step-number {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      line-height: 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--paper);
      border: 2px solid var(--line);
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .step-label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .progress-step.active .step-number {
      background: var(--pine);
      border-color: var(--pine);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(30, 107, 82, 0.3);
  }

  .progress-step.active .step-label {
      color: var(--pine-ink);
      font-weight: 600;
  }

  .progress-step.active {
      color: var(--pine-ink);
  }

  .progress-step.completed .step-number {
      background: var(--pine);
      border-color: var(--pine);
      color: #fff;
  }

  .progress-step.completed .step-label {
      color: var(--pine-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .progress-bar-container {
          padding: 0.5rem 0.2rem;
          flex-wrap: nowrap;
          overflow-x: auto;
          -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
          scrollbar-width: none;
          gap: 0.2rem;
      }
      .progress-bar-container::-webkit-scrollbar {
          display: none;
      }
      .progress-step {
          flex: 0 0 auto;
          min-width: 44px;
          padding: 0.3rem 0.1rem;
      }
      .step-label {
          font-size: 0.5rem;
      }
      .step-number {
          width: 24px;
          height: 24px;
          line-height: 24px;
          font-size: 0.65rem;
      }
      .progress-step:not(:last-child)::after {
          width: 8%;
          right: -4%;
      }
  }

  /* ===== TOOLTIPS D'AIDE ===== */
  .tooltip-trigger {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: help;
      color: var(--pine);
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 0 0.2rem;
      padding: 0;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      position: relative;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      background: var(--pine-soft);
      border: none;
      font-family: var(--sans);
      user-select: none;
      vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .tooltip-trigger:hover {
      background: var(--pine);
      color: #fff;
  }

  .tooltip-trigger::after {
      content: attr(data-tooltip);
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 150%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%) scale(0.95);
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: normal;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      white-space: normal;
      min-width: 200px;
      max-width: 300px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      z-index: 1000;
      text-align: left;
      pointer-events: none;
      line-height: 1.5;
      font-family: var(--sans);
  }

  .tooltip-trigger::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 150%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px);
      border: 6px solid transparent;
      border-top-color: var(--ink);
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      z-index: 1000;
      pointer-events: none;
  }

  .tooltip-trigger:hover::after,
  .tooltip-trigger:hover::before {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
  }

  .tooltip-trigger:hover::after {
      transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="top">
    <p class="kicker">Vente de particulier à particulier</p>
    <h1>Menez votre vente jusqu'au notaire, sans agence.</h1>
    <p>Un fil conducteur pour rassembler les bons documents, publier une annonce conforme et transmettre un dossier complet à l'étude. Vous restez maître de chaque décision.</p>
    <span class="save"><span class="dot"></span><span id="saveState">Dossier enregistré sur cet appareil</span></span>
  </header>

  <!-- Bandeau de progression -->
  <div class="progress-bar-container" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="1" aria-valuemin="1" aria-valuemax="6">
    <div class="progress-step active" data-step="1">
      <span class="step-number">1</span>
      <span class="step-label">Bien</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-step" data-step="2">
      <span class="step-number">2</span>
      <span class="step-label">Dossier</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-step" data-step="3">
      <span class="step-number">3</span>
      <span class="step-label">Annonce</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-step" data-step="4">
      <span class="step-number">4</span>
      <span class="step-label">Visiteurs</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-step" data-step="5">
      <span class="step-number">5</span>
      <span class="step-label">Offre</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-step" data-step="6">
      <span class="step-number">6</span>
      <span class="step-label">Notaire</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <nav class="steps" id="stepper" aria-label="Étapes de la vente"></nav>

  <!-- STEP 1 -->
  <section class="panel" data-step="1" aria-labelledby="t1">
    <p class="eyebrow">Étape 1 sur 6</p>
    <h2 id="t1">Identifier le bien &amp; ses diagnostics</h2>
    <p class="lead">On situe précisément le bien, puis on en déduit la liste légale des diagnostics à réaliser avant la mise en vente.</p>

    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Adresse du bien</h3>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="f" for="q">Rechercher une adresse</label>
          <input type="text" id="q" autocomplete="off" placeholder="12 rue des Écoles, Douarnenez…">
          <p class="hint" id="addrState">Source : Base Adresse Nationale (service public, gratuit).</p>
          <div class="results" id="results"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="officialLinks" style="display:none">
          <p class="hint" style="margin-top:14px"><strong>Outils officiels pour cette commune :</strong></p>
          <div class="links">
            <a href="https://app.dvf.etalab.gouv.fr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Prix de vente réels autour du bien (DVF) ↗</a>
            <a href="https://www.cadastre.gouv.fr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Repérer la parcelle sur le cadastre ↗</a>
            <a href="https://www.georisques.gouv.fr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Générer l'état des risques (Géorisques / ERRIAL) ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Caractéristiques</h3>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="f" for="ptype">Type de bien</label>
          <select id="ptype" data-field="property_type">
            <option>Maison</option><option>Appartement</option><option>Terrain</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="f" for="year">Année de construction</label>
          <input type="number" id="year" data-field="build_year" min="1700" max="2026">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="f" for="surface">Surface habitable (m²)</label>
          <input type="number" id="surface" data-field="surface" min="1">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label class="f" for="dpe">Classe DPE (si vous la connaissez déjà)</label>
          <select id="dpe" data-field="dpe_rating">
            <option value="">Je ne sais pas encore</option>
            <option>A</option><option>B</option><option>C</option><option>D</option><option>E</option><option>F</option><option>G</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-field="is_condo"><span>Le bien est en copropriété</span></label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-field="elec_over_15"><span>Installation électrique de plus de 15 ans</span></label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-field="has_gas"><span>Présence d'une installation au gaz</span></label>
        <label class="check" id="gasAgeRow" style="display:none"><input type="checkbox" data-field="gas_over_15"><span>Installation de gaz de plus de 15 ans</span></label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-field="zone_termites"><span>Bien situé en zone à risque termites <small>(défini par arrêté préfectoral — vérifiable en mairie ou sur Géorisques)</small></span></label>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-field="assainissement_nc"><span>Assainissement non collectif <small>(fosse / non raccordé au tout-à-l'égout)</small></span></label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Diagnostics obligatoires pour votre bien</h3>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:-6px;margin-bottom:12px">Cochez ceux que vous avez déjà fait réaliser. La liste s'ajuste à vos réponses ci-dessus.</p>
      <div id="diagList"></div>
      <div id="auditHint"></div>
      <p class="hint" style="margin-top:14px">Annuaire officiel des diagnostiqueurs certifiés : <a href="https://diagnostiqueurs.din.developpement-durable.gouv.fr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ministère de la Transition écologique ↗</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STEP 2 -->
  <section class="panel" data-step="2" aria-labelledby="t2">
    <p class="eyebrow">Étape 2 sur 6</p>
    <h2 id="t2">Rassembler le dossier juridique</h2>
    <p class="lead">Ces pièces prouvent que vous pouvez vendre et évitent les mauvaises surprises à la signature.</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Documents de propriété</h3>
        <div id="docsGeneral"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Copropriété</h3>
        <div id="docsCondo"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Exemple de tooltip -->
    <div class="note">
      <strong>Condition suspensive de prêt</strong>
      <span class="tooltip-trigger" data-tooltip="L'acheteur a généralement 45 à 60 jours pour obtenir son accord de prêt définitif. Sans cet accord, la vente peut être annulée sans pénalité pour l'acheteur.">ⓘ</span>
      : l'acheteur dispose d'un délai pour obtenir son financement.
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STEP 3 -->
  <section class="panel" data-step="3" aria-labelledby="t3">
    <p class="eyebrow">Étape 3 sur 6</p>
    <h2 id="t3">Rédiger l'annonce</h2>
    <p class="lead">On génère un texte prêt à copier, avec les mentions légales d'affichage (DPE, risques) déjà intégrées.</p>
    <div class="grid2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Paramètres</h3>
        <div class="field"><label class="f" for="price">Prix de vente affiché (€)</label><input type="number" id="price" data-field="price_target" step="1000"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="f" for="rooms">Nombre de pièces</label><input type="number" id="rooms" data-field="rooms" min="1"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="f" for="ges">Classe climat (GES)</label>
          <select id="ges" data-field="ges_rating">
            <option value="">—</option><option>A</option><option>B</option><option>C</option><option>D</option><option>E</option><option>F</option><option>G</option>
          </select></div>
        <div class="grid2">
          <div class="field"><label class="f" for="emin">Énergie 
